{
    "title": "Santa Prank Call: Fake video",
    "description": "\ud83d\ude1c Ho ho ho! This is a call from Santa, dear! Let's take the phone now!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Do you want to prank your friends like they are getting a Santa call in real life? Do you want to receive realistic video call from Santa Claus for a festive holiday?\r\n\r\nThis prank app simulating Santa call helps you speak to Santa easily. Use it now to make a fake video call and start your adventure to North Pole!\r\n\r\nSANTA PRANK CALL: FAKE VIDEO FEATURES:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf84 Receive a call from Santa Claus \r\nChristmas is more fun with this fake santa calling app. Wondering how to call Santa? Just use this app for a fake Santa call. Tap the button and wait for the Christmas magic!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf84 Make a fake video call with Santa\r\nPrank your friends by sending them a video call from Santa with this prank app. Select from many adorable Santa characters, including a Santa Horror, with the 'video call option.' Whether it's during your leisure time, before bedtime, or even before heading to work, make a call to Santa and add a touch of magic to your day.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf84 Chat with Santa\r\nExperience a holly-jolly of Santa pranks and spread joy with delightful messages from Santa and the enchanting North Pole!\r\n\r\nLet's break the boredom and use Santa Prank Call to prank your friends and unlock new joy of Christmas holiday!\r\n\ud83c\udf89 Are you ready for FUN? Download FREE right now! \r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd21 Don't forget this is a prank app and just a call imitation with recorded video, the Santa Prank Call: Fake Video does not let you talk with the real Santa Claus. \ud83d\ude01\ud83d\udcf1\r\n\r\nPrank dial will be updated weekly, so don't hesitate to let us know the characters you want to fake video call with. Also, we love to hear stories when you prank your friends with our joke app. Please share them with the game feedback below \ud83d\ude46\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\ude46\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\ude46\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\r\n\r\nThank you so much for supporting our game. Your support has become the biggest motivation for Era Team to try our best and create the highest quality game for users \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udcbb\r\n\r\nOnce again, we would like to express our gratitude and wish you all the best! \ud83e\udd70\r\nEra Team.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\ude1c Ho ho ho! This is a call from Santa, dear! Let&#39;s take the phone now!<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1 Do you want to prank your friends like they are getting a Santa call in real life? Do you want to receive realistic video call from Santa Claus for a festive holiday?<br><br>This prank app simulating Santa call helps you speak to Santa easily. Use it now to make a fake video call and start your adventure to North Pole!<br><br>SANTA PRANK CALL: FAKE VIDEO FEATURES:<br><br>\ud83c\udf84 Receive a call from Santa Claus <br>Christmas is more fun with this fake santa calling app. Wondering how to call Santa? Just use this app for a fake Santa call. Tap the button and wait for the Christmas magic!<br><br>\ud83c\udf84 Make a fake video call with Santa<br>Prank your friends by sending them a video call from Santa with this prank app. Select from many adorable Santa characters, including a Santa Horror, with the &#39;video call option.&#39; Whether it&#39;s during your leisure time, before bedtime, or even before heading to work, make a call to Santa and add a touch of magic to your day.<br><br>\ud83c\udf84 Chat with Santa<br>Experience a holly-jolly of Santa pranks and spread joy with delightful messages from Santa and the enchanting North Pole!<br><br>Let&#39;s break the boredom and use Santa Prank Call to prank your friends and unlock new joy of Christmas holiday!<br>\ud83c\udf89 Are you ready for FUN? Download FREE right now! <br><br>\ud83e\udd21 Don&#39;t forget this is a prank app and just a call imitation with recorded video, the Santa Prank Call: Fake Video does not let you talk with the real Santa Claus. \ud83d\ude01\ud83d\udcf1<br><br>Prank dial will be updated weekly, so don&#39;t hesitate to let us know the characters you want to fake video call with. Also, we love to hear stories when you prank your friends with our joke app. Please share them with the game feedback below \ud83d\ude46\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\ude46\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\ude46\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<br><br>Thank you so much for supporting our game. Your support has become the biggest motivation for Era Team to try our best and create the highest quality game for users \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udcbb<br><br>Once again, we would like to express our gratitude and wish you all the best! \ud83e\udd70<br>Era Team.",
